{"id":1026,"title":{"romaji":"Hai to Gensou no Grimgar","english":"Grimgar of Fantasy and Ash","native":"灰と幻想のグリムガル"},"slug":"hai_to_gensou_no_grimgar","synopsis":"Fear, survival, instinct. Thrown into a foreign land with nothing but hazy memories and the knowledge of their name, they can feel only these three emotions resonating deep within their souls. A group of strangers is given no other choice than to accept the only paying job in this game-like world—the role of a soldier in the Reserve Army—and eliminate anything that threatens the peace in their new world, Grimgar.\n\n\nWhen all of the stronger candidates join together, those left behind must create a party together to survive: Manato, a charismatic leader and priest; Haruhiro, a nervous thief; Yume, a cheerful hunter; Shihoru, a shy mage; Mogzo, a kind warrior; and Ranta, a rowdy dark knight. Despite its resemblance to one, this is no game—there are no redos or respawns; it is kill or be killed.\n\n\nIt is now up to this ragtag group of unlikely fighters to survive together in a world where life and death are separated only by a fine line.\n","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2016,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:51","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 02:43:46","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":31859},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":21428},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":11447},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":11712},{"site":"ANN","externalId":17732},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":7555},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"HULU","externalId":null},{"site":"NETFLIX","externalId":80142717},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":2043,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/jPVBq9jvPYLBy8n4pxy9D1sbxilwUFvs4wXCxVAV.jpg"},{"id":2044,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/EjR5Wfd9neh76P6IovCKvq6GG3U7OZbgLwECMggj.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":8,"name":"A-1 Pictures","slug":"a_1_pictures"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"an